{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本外相茂木敏充與俄羅斯外長拉夫羅夫周五（30日）在美國亞特蘭大舉行的二十國集團（G20）外長會議期間會面，是日俄外相五年來首次正式面對面會談，其間前者要求俄方立即釋放10月被捕的日本記者今井裕紀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.143814+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T08:49:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.793233+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.059881+00:00","content_hash":"8b828c24e39be289cc906d2d39c824f350d2c40311fe01b11180d18e5ed2103e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}